        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story section-grid" id="why-tsoi">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="story-layout">
          <div class="founder-portrait">
            <img src="assets/ankit-profile.webp" alt="Ankit Pushpraj, CEO, The Schools of India" width="560" height="560" loading="lazy">
            <div class="portrait-caption"><strong>Ankit Pushpraj</strong><span>CEO, The Schools of India</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="story-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> The Story behind TSOI</div>
            <h2>Every education summit forgot the one person <em>it's for.</em></h2>
            <p>For years, India's education conferences have filled rooms with founders, principals and vendors - and left one chair empty. The student. The person every decision in that room is actually about.</p>
            <p>TSOI puts that right. Founders, principals, educators and the students they serve sit at the same table, in the same sessions, solving the same problems - not students as a keynote moment, but as delegates.</p>
            <blockquote>“Nobody designed education conferences to leave students out. It just happened that way, year after year.”</blockquote>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-heading benefits-heading">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Benefits</div>
            <h2>Why You Should Be Here</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Not just a goodie bag. Not just an award. Six things worth carrying back to your school on Day 4.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-grid">
          <article class="benefit-card accent-magenta"><span class="card-number">01</span><h3>Practical ideas</h3><p>Not frameworks in theory - practices other schools have already tested, refined, and are willing to hand over exactly as they run them.</p></article>
          <article class="benefit-card accent-violet"><span class="card-number">02</span><h3>The TSOI Playbook</h3><p>A working document built live across all three days - every SOP and framework that surfaced in the room, yours to adapt long after the summit ends.</p></article>
          <article class="benefit-card accent-lime"><span class="card-number">03</span><h3>One problem, a concrete solution</h3><p>Walk in stuck on something specific. Walk out with either a sharper way to think about it, or the name of someone who's already solved it.</p></article>
          <article class="benefit-card accent-cyan"><span class="card-number">04</span><h3>5-10 real relationships</h3><p>Not LinkedIn connections made in a coffee queue - the kind built over three days solving the same problems in the same room. People you'll actually call.</p></article>
          <article class="benefit-card accent-magenta"><span class="card-number">05</span><h3>A sharper question</h3><p>The question you walked in with won't survive three days of pushback from people who've built what you're trying to build. You'll leave with a better one.</p></article>
          <article class="benefit-card accent-violet"><span class="card-number">06</span><h3>One experiment</h3><p>Paired with someone in the room to keep you honest, you leave with exactly one change to run the week you're back - not a list of forty you'll never open again.</p></article>
        </div>
        <div class="section-cta"><a class="btn btn-dark" href="#final-form">Request Call Back <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="people" id="people">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading people-heading">
          <div><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span></span> Who's in the room</div><h2>Voices shaping the <em>TSOI room.</em></h2></div>
          <p>Founders, school builders and education voices bringing different perspectives into one practical room.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" aria-label="TSOI speakers and board of advisory">
          <span class="tab-button active">Featured Speakers &amp; Board of Advisory</span>
        </div>

        <div class="people-panel active">
          <div class="people-grid people-scroll">
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/dr.-lakshmi-kumar.webp" alt="Dr. Lakshmi Kumar" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-both">Featured Speaker + Board of Advisory</span><h3>Dr. Lakshmi Kumar</h3><p>Director - Avasara Academy</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/dr.-sanjay-malpani.webp" alt="Dr. Sanjay Malpani" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-both">Featured Speaker + Board of Advisory</span><h3>Dr. Sanjay Malpani</h3><p>Chairman - Dhruv Global School</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/dr.-parimal-merchant.webp" alt="Dr. Parimal Merchant" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-both">Featured Speaker + Board of Advisory</span><h3>Dr. Parimal Merchant</h3><p>Director - GFMB, SP Jain School of Global Management</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/kiran-bir-sethi.webp" alt="Kiran Bir Sethi" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-both">Featured Speaker + Board of Advisory</span><h3>Kiran Bir Sethi</h3><p>Founder - The Riverside High School</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/sanjay-jain.webp" alt="Sanjay Jain" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Sanjay Jain</h3><p>Head - Google for Education, India</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/aneesh-bangia.webp" alt="Aneesh Bangia" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Aneesh Bangia</h3><p>Co-founder - Open Door and Thinking Classroom</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/umes-shreshtha.webp" alt="Umes Shreshtha" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Umes Shreshtha</h3><p>Director - CIPL, King's College, Nepal</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/devika-nadig.webp" alt="Devika Nadig" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Devika Nadig</h3><p>Director - Shikshangan Education Initiatives</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/dr.-ganesh-natrajan.webp" alt="Dr. Ganesh Natrajan" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Dr. Ganesh Natrajan</h3><p>Former Chairman NASSCOM</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/preethi-vickram.webp" alt="Preethi Vickram" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Preethi Vickram</h3><p>Founder - Tapas Progressive Learning</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/dr.-swati-popat-vats.webp" alt="Dr. Swati Popat Vats" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-both">Featured Speaker + Board of Advisory</span><h3>Dr. Swati Popat Vats</h3><p>President - ECA &amp; Podar Education Network</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/speakers/manjushree-patil.webp" alt="Manjushree Patil" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role">Featured Speaker</span><h3>Manjushree Patil</h3><p>Founder - Director Aatman Academy</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/advisors/russell_cailey.webp" alt="Russell John Cailey" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-advisor">Board of Advisory</span><h3>Russell John Cailey</h3><p>CEO &amp; Founder, Almach AI™</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/advisors/seetha_murty.webp" alt="Dr. Seetha Murty" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-advisor">Board of Advisory</span><h3>Dr. Seetha Murty</h3><p>President - Association for Heads of IB World Schools</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/advisors/mrunal_shah.webp" alt="Mrunal Shah" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-advisor">Board of Advisory</span><h3>Mrunal Shah</h3><p>Founder &amp; Play Expert, Sunday Bricks</p></article>
            <article class="person-card"><img src="assets/advisors/alka_pandey.webp" alt="Alka Pandey" loading="lazy"><span class="person-role role-advisor">Board of Advisory</span><h3>Alka Pandey</h3><p>Academic Advisor - South Asia, Cambridge International</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="partners">
          <span>Our Partners</span>
          <div class="partner-logos">
            <img src="assets/logos/edumojo.webp" alt="Edu Mojo" loading="lazy">
            <img src="assets/logos/stockpaperscissors.webp" alt="Stock Paper Scissors" loading="lazy">
            <img src="assets/logos/tezticket.webp" alt="TezTicket" loading="lazy">
            <img src="assets/logos/gameplan.webp" alt="Game Plan" loading="lazy">
            <img src="assets/logos/bloomed.webp" alt="bloomed" loading="lazy">
            <img src="assets/logos/imagicaa.svg" alt="Imagicaa" loading="lazy">
