    <section class="experience section-grid" id="experience">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="experience-intro">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> What your 3 days look like</div>
          <h2>Three days designed to change what you <em>take back to school.</em></h2>
          <p>Not three days of passive listening. Every day moves you from conversation to practical action.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="journey" data-journey>
          <div class="journey-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Summit days">
            <button class="journey-tab active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="journey-day-0"><span>30<sup>th</sup> Oct</span><strong>Arrive &amp; Belong</strong><i class="journey-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</i></button>
            <button class="journey-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="journey-day-1"><span>31<sup>st</sup> Oct</span><strong>Question Everything</strong><i class="journey-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</i></button>
            <button class="journey-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="journey-day-2"><span>1<sup>st</sup> Nov</span><strong>Build What's Next</strong><i class="journey-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</i></button>
          </div>

          <div class="journey-panel active" id="journey-day-0" role="tabpanel">
            <div class="journey-number">01</div>
            <div class="journey-copy"><span class="journey-label">Day 0</span><h3>Arrive as delegates. Begin as a community.</h3><p>Settle in, meet the people behind the room and start the summit with reflection, conversation and connection.</p></div>
            <ul><li>Arrival &amp; Check-In</li><li>Opening Performance</li><li>Why We Built This</li><li>Reflective School</li><li>Live Music &amp; Dinner</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="journey-panel" id="journey-day-1" role="tabpanel" hidden>
            <div class="journey-number">02</div>
            <div class="journey-copy"><span class="journey-label">Day 1</span><h3>Challenge assumptions with students in the room.</h3><p>Move beyond presentations through student-led conversations, parallel tracks and honest questions about today's schools.</p></div>
            <ul><li>Yoga &amp; Breakfast</li><li>You Can Make It Happen</li><li>Students Take Over</li><li>Parallel Tracks</li><li>Every Child, Across the Range</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="journey-panel" id="journey-day-2" role="tabpanel" hidden>
            <div class="journey-number">03</div>
            <div class="journey-copy"><span class="journey-label">Day 2</span><h3>Turn the conversation into your next move.</h3><p>Study what is already working, build alongside peers and leave with one clear commitment for the week you return.</p></div>
            <ul><li>Built by One Generation</li><li>The Indian Classroom at a Crossroads</li><li>The 5% Showcase</li><li>When I Go Back...</li><li>Closing Reflection</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="experience-formats" id="tsoi-experience">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="difference-block">
          <div class="difference-heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> The TSOI Experience</div><h3>Participation, not content consumption.</h3><p>Every format at the TSOI Summit puts you in a room working a real problem - not listening to one.</p></div>
          <div class="difference-grid">
            <article class="difference-card sharing"><b>5%</b><div><h4>The 5% Sharing Sessions</h4><p>Schools showcasing what works that others can copy.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card differently"><b>↻</b><div><h4>What We'd Do Differently</h4><p>Experienced leaders on the decisions, systems and assumptions they'd approach differently today.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card school"><b>2035</b><div><h4>The School of 2035</h4><p>Redesigning a school from scratch, with students at the table.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card wellness"><b>✦</b><div><h4>Wellness &amp; Networking</h4><p>Yoga &amp; mindfulness sessions along with the TSOI Gala Dinner &amp; community launch event.</p></div></article>
            <article class="difference-card problems"><b>⌘</b><div><h4>Problem Rooms</h4><p>Dedicated breakout sessions for next-gen founders, principals &amp; educators.</p></div></article>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="retreat-strip">
          <div class="retreat-media"><img src="assets/novotel-imagicaa-khopoli.png" alt="Novotel Imagicaa hotel in Khopoli" width="408" height="272" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="retreat-copy"><span>3-Day Residential Learning Retreat for K-12 Educators</span><h3>Novotel Imagicaa, Khopoli</h3><p>Accommodation, meals and the complete summit experience in one location.</p></div>
          <a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Novotel+Imagicaa+Khopoli" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View location <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </aside>

        <div class="experience-conversion"><div><span>Ready to be part of the room?</span><p>Join 300 school leaders for three days of practical learning.</p></div><div><a class="btn btn-primary track-register" href="https://www.tezticket.com/events/TSOIS/sub_events/298" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reserve Your Seat <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="callback-link" href="#final-form">Request a Call Back</a></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="final-section" id="faqs">
      <div class="container final-layout">
        <div class="faq-column">
          <div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light"><span></span> Assistance</div>
          <h2>Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
          <div class="faq-list">
            <article class="faq-item open"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>Who can attend The Schools of India Summit 2026?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>The Summit is open to everyone in education - school founders, directors and trustees, principals and academic heads, teachers and educators, EdTech founders, and anyone building or working in education.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is accommodation included?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Hotel accommodation is included for delegates at Novotel Imagicaa, Khopoli.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will delegates receive a participation kit?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Every delegate receives a participation kit, along with plenty of takeaways to carry back to their school.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Are meals included?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. All meals across the three days of the Summit are covered.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can schools register as a group?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Schools can register an entire school delegation as well - you'll find that option on the registration page.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is parking available, and how do I get to the venue?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes, parking is available at the venue. Transfers are also covered from the nearest airports, so you're taken care of on arrival.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can I transfer my ticket to someone else?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>No. Tickets are non-transferable.</p></div></article>
            <article class="faq-item"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will there be takeaways from the sessions?</span><i>+</i></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes - delegates will leave with plenty of practical takeaways from across the three days of the Summit.</p></div></article>
          </div>
        </div>

